    "Written in place rather than replaced, so a symlink into a dotfiles repo survives every save. On launch the file wins over local settings — that is what makes a fresh checkout come up configured, and what makes a second Mac pick up the settings iCloud sent it rather than publish its own over them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Written in place rather than replaced, so a symlink into a dotfiles repo survives every save. On launch the file wins over local settings — that is what makes a fresh checkout come up configured, and what makes a second Mac pick up the settings iCloud sent it rather than publish its own over them."
          }
        }
